# Sanctum Lurker: "When this creature enters, empower Jace 1" makes Bot1 a Jace planeswalker token with 0 loyalty and puts
# one loyalty counter on it (CR 701.71a). Jace's −1 (Surveil 1) leaves it at 0 loyalty, and "Planeswalkers you control
# aren't put into their owners' graveyards for having 0 loyalty" keeps it on the battlefield (CR 704.5i). It may not
# activate a second loyalty ability that turn (CR 606.3: the card's ruling, however many it has gained), but on turn 3 it
# activates the granted "[+2]: This planeswalker deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life" from 0 (the
# ruling): Bot2 goes to 19, Bot1 to 21, and Jace to 2 loyalty.

